					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te hisce diebus per <persName ref="p495">Bullingerum</persName> <placeName>Brugensem</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cognatum tuum, et ea quidem, quae tum scripsi, confirmantur <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>adhuc apud nos excepto eo, quod <persName ref="p18575">Hispaniarum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>rex</persName> in Flandria appulerit; affirmatur tamen eum venturum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et <persName ref="p20341">regem Galliae</persName> una cum matre ad eum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>profecturum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> quidem nihil his diebus accepimus; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illi poterunt de his rebus habere certa, mirumqu<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>e est nobis, quod nihil scribant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Expecto itaque anxie literas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quum ab illis tum a vobis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ducem <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>adhuc ferunt esse <placeName>Tononii</placeName> et <placeName>Ripariis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quidam <placeName>Tononiens<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>es</placeName> ab eo petierunt missae restitutionem; quibus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>graviter ipsemet respondit, si missas audire velint, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut eant in alios locos, ubi ea celebretur; se servare <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>velle id, quod dominis <placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName> promiserit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Concessit <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>etiam ministris consistorium et alia quędam, quę <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ad disciplinam et gubernationem ecclesiae pertinent.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Audimus interea ipsum pro se clanculariam missam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>habuisse in castro <placeName>Tononiensi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Alias iam nihil <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>habeo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quod <persName>Muraltum</persName> hunc nostrum concernit, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>res illius iam ad finem deductae sunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus a <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p7682">Mülinen</persName> consuli vestro nihil respondere voluit, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quoniam ex literis quibusdam deprehensis cognover<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>at rem iam prius inter hunc et filiam illius transactam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>esse; expectavit ergo, donec illa Gaio rediret, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ubi cum praefecto eius loci <persName>Antonio Tillyero</persName> egerat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Postquam illa venit, voluit rem omnem cognoscere; tum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ipsa fassa est, quod ei fidem promiserit; itaque pulsa <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>est e domo patria, et res ad consistorium pervenit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ibi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quoniam plane sine ulla exceptione confiteretur, quod <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ei nupsisset atque insuper etiam ipsum habere vellet, indicatum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>est ratum esse debere illud coniugium, ita tamen <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ut, si pater puellae promissionem hanc irritam facere <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>vellet, quae absque illius consensu facta esset, posset <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>hoc secundum leges, quae concedunt hanc potestatem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>parentibus, si liberi infra aetatis annum vigesimum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>propria authoritate et voluntate se obstringunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>cum ille videret puellę constantiam, noluit promissionem <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>disrumpere, sed concessit, ut cum ea nuptias <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>celebraret, ita tamen ut omni dote careant, quoniam <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ille ausus esset hoc ipso non interrogato facere <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>et illa tam malum inobedientiae exemplum in familiam <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>suam induxisset.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Duxit itaque eam secum in aedes <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>magistri sui, apud quem agit, propediem nuptias cum <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ea celebraturus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Proficiscitur tamen prius <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>, ut, quomodo <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>res suae habeant, matri et amicis indicet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Scribo <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>haec ad te, quoniam tu quoque in causa hac laborasti per d. de <placeName ref="l90">Cham</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>ut et illi et d. <persName>Thaddaeo Duno</persName> indicare possis, quomodo <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>res habeat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri omnes; saluta <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>tuos quoque meo nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[<lb xml:id="p1z50"/>ohanne] Hall[erus</persName>] tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Scripsi priora ante triduum, cum mihi <persName>Muraltus</persName> certam <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>spem fecisset se mox abiturum.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Interea adhuc haeret cum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>sponsa sua, a qua aegre avellitur.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Cum igitur puer hic eat, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>volui ipsi has dare literas.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Prioribus vero haec addere <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tantum placet: 1. Quod rumores illos <placeName ref="l832">Gallicos</placeName> attinet, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>evanescere illos paulatim et hoc etiam interea ex <placeName ref="l167">Genev<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>a</placeName> quibusdam nostratium scriptum esse.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Es sig wol ein mechtig <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>spannen zuͦ beeden syten und heimlische rüstumg; doch sige <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>man guͦter hoffnung, die sach werden bliben beruͦwen; das <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>welle gott, den wir drumb bitten sond.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l875">Hispano</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>iterum affirmant aliqui eum appulisse in <placeName ref="l640">Flandria</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Ich <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>weiß bald nit, was ich glauben sol.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Die unseren sind <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>gurlobet imm läger.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Dubitatur a quibusdam, an illi fingant <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>causam hanc aut an aliud subsit, cognoscemus tamen brevi <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>rei veritatem.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">2. <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Hütt kumpt <persName ref="p464">Brunnerus</persName> wider <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>von <placeName ref="l210">Heydelberg</placeName> mitt wyb und kinden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de">Ich weiß nitt, was <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>wir mitt imm wend, weiß auch nitt, ob er von minen her<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>ren angnon wirt oder nitt; es wirt kum gon, so er also zänkisch sin <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>sol.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de">3. So kumpt auch <persName ref="p7201">Zornii</persName> filius; <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>sag<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>t mir <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>vom prädicanten von <placeName ref="l487">Steckborn</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de">Lieber, laßend mich wüßen, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>wie es imm gange.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Haec prioribus subiicere volui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Rogo, ut boni consulas, s<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>i interdum incerta scribo; cogita me quoque non habere certos nuncios.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 23. septembris 1567.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino meo honorando et compatri colendissimo ac charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>